{"seq":1,"slug":"mvcc-read-view-consistent-read","title":"MVCC 与 Read View：快照读/当前读与 RC/RR 可见性差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/mysql-innodb-storage-engine-mvcc-internals/mvcc-lock-isolation-ops/mvcc-read-view-consistent-read","wordCount":2132,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"mvcc-与-read-view-快照读-当前读与-rc-rr-可见性差异\">MVCC 与 Read View：快照读/当前读与 RC/RR 可见性差异</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-快照读-当前读与-read-view-的三方关系\">核心概念：快照读、当前读与 Read View 的三方关系</h2><p>同一条 <code>SELECT</code> 在 InnoDB 里可能走两条完全不同的路径，取决于它有没有锁读语法。普通 <code>SELECT</code> 走<strong>一致性非锁定读</strong>——&quot;uses multi-versioning to present to a query a snapshot of the database at a point in time&quot;，且 &quot;does not set any locks on the tables it accesses&quot;（<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-consistent-read.html\">InnoDB Consistent Nonlocking Reads, MySQL 8.4</a>）。它读到的是时间点快照，不是数据页上的最新字节。</p>\n<p>带 <code>FOR UPDATE</code> / <code>FOR SHARE</code> 的语句走<strong>当前读（locking read）</strong>：&quot;reads the latest available data, setting exclusive locks on each row it reads&quot;，锁在事务&quot;committed or rolled back&quot;时释放（<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-locking-reads.html\">InnoDB Locking Reads, MySQL 8.4</a>）。<code>UPDATE</code> / <code>DELETE</code> 内部用的也是它。</p>\n<p>第三块拼图是 <strong>Read View</strong>：快照读能看到什么完全由它决定，其成员与可见性算法定义在 InnoDB 源码 <code>storage/innobase/include/read0types.h</code>（<a href=\"https://github.com/mysql/mysql-server/blob/8.0/storage/innobase/include/read0types.h\">mysql-server 8.0 read0types.h</a>）。一句话概括三者关系：<strong>Read View 决定&quot;哪些事务的改动可见&quot;，undo 版本链决定&quot;历史版本从哪里取&quot;，锁路径决定&quot;绕过 Read View 直接读最新值&quot;</strong>。逐跳回溯见 <a href=\"../redo-undo-wal-crash-recovery/undo-log-purge-version-chain\">undo log 与 purge：回滚段、版本链与 undo 表空间回收</a>；承载指针的隐藏列见 <a href=\"../bplus-tree-row-format-page/innodb-row-format-compact-dynamic\">InnoDB 行格式：COMPACT/DYNAMIC、变长列、隐藏列与溢出页</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;SELECT 语句&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;带 FOR UPDATE / FOR SHARE ?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;否:快照读&quot;| C[&quot;查 Read View&lt;br/&gt;m_ids + 水位线&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;是:当前读&quot;| D[&quot;读最新已提交版本&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;按 DB_TRX_ID 判定可见性&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;不可见&quot;| F[&quot;沿 DB_ROLL_PTR&lt;br/&gt;回溯 undo 链&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;加行锁 / 间隙锁&lt;br/&gt;冲突则等待&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"SELECT 语句\"] --&gt; B{\"带 FOR UPDATE / FOR SHARE ?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"否:快照读\"| C[\"查 Read View&lt;br/&gt;m_ids + 水位线\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"是:当前读\"| D[\"读最新已提交版本\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"按 DB_TRX_ID 判定可见性\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"不可见\"| F[\"沿 DB_ROLL_PTR&lt;br/&gt;回溯 undo 链\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"加行锁 / 间隙锁&lt;br/&gt;冲突则等待\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>快照读（consistent read）</th>\n<th>当前读（locking read）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发语法</td>\n<td>普通 <code>SELECT</code></td>\n<td><code>FOR UPDATE</code> / <code>FOR SHARE</code> / <code>UPDATE</code> / <code>DELETE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读哪个版本</td>\n<td>Read View 判定出的可见版本</td>\n<td>最新已提交版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否加锁</td>\n<td>不加锁</td>\n<td>加行锁；范围查再加间隙 / next-key 锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撞上未提交事务</td>\n<td>不等待，回查 undo</td>\n<td>等待持锁事务结束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"read-view-的内部结构-五个字段与可见性判定\">Read View 的内部结构：五个字段与可见性判定</h2><p>Read View 不是&quot;一份数据副本&quot;，而是<strong>事务 ID 的边界组</strong>。<code>ReadView</code> 类的五个成员决定它能看多远：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成员</th>\n<th>源码注释含义</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>m_low_limit_id</code></td>\n<td>&quot;should not see any transaction with trx id &gt;= this&quot;，称 &quot;high water mark&quot;</td>\n<td>高水位：创建快照时<strong>下一个待分配</strong>事务号，达到它不可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>m_up_limit_id</code></td>\n<td>&quot;trx ids which are strictly smaller (&lt;) than this value&quot;，称 &quot;low water mark&quot;</td>\n<td>低水位：创建时的<strong>最小活跃事务号</strong>，低于它可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>m_ids</code></td>\n<td>&quot;Set of RW transactions that was active when this snapshot&quot;</td>\n<td>快照创建时仍活跃的读写事务集合，<strong>有序存储</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>m_creator_trx_id</code></td>\n<td>&quot;set to TRX_ID_MAX for free&quot;</td>\n<td>创建者事务号，保证看得到自己的写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>m_low_limit_no</code></td>\n<td>该视图不需要序号低于此值的 undo</td>\n<td>给 purge 的下界：本视图让多少 undo 不能删</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>m_ids</code> 刻意保持有序（&quot;Insert the value in the correct slot, preserving the order&quot;），是为了让判定用<strong>二分查找</strong>。判定入口 <code>changes_visible(trx_id_t id, const table_name_t &amp;name)</code> 分支顺序固定：<code>ut_ad(id &gt; 0)</code> 要求事务号为正；<code>if (id &lt; m_up_limit_id || id == m_creator_trx_id) return (true);</code> 低于低水位或就是自己即可见；<code>check_trx_id_sanity(id, name)</code> 校验越界；<code>if (id &gt;= m_low_limit_id) return (false);</code> 达到高水位不可见；<code>else if (m_ids.empty()) return (true);</code> 中间区间无活跃事务可见；否则 <code>return (!std::binary_search(p, p + m_ids.size(), id));</code>——<strong>在 <code>m_ids</code> 里找到 = 快照创建时它还活跃 = 不可见；找不到 = 已提交 = 可见</strong>。写成谓词：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>visible</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>up_limit</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>∨</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>creator</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>∨</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mtext>up_limit</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>low_limit</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mtext>m_ids</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{visible}(id) = \\big(id &lt; \\text{up\\_limit}\\big) \\lor \\big(id = \\text{creator}\\big) \\lor \\Big(\\text{up\\_limit} \\le id &lt; \\text{low\\_limit} \\land id \\notin \\text{m\\_ids}\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">visible</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">up_limit</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">creator</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">up_limit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">low_limit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m_ids</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>InnoDB 另有语义更弱的 <code>sees(id)</code>，只做低水位判断——两者不可混用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可见性判定推演-水位线与版本链回溯\">可见性判定推演：水位线与版本链回溯</h2><p>假设快照创建瞬间：事务 100 已提交、102 活跃未提交、下一个待分配事务号是 105。则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>up_limit</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>102</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{up\\_limit}=102</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">up_limit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">102</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>low_limit</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>105</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{low\\_limit}=105</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">low_limit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">105</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>102</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\_ids=\\{102\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">102</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>creator</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>101</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{creator}=101</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">creator</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">101</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行上 <code>DB_TRX_ID</code></th>\n<th>判定路径</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>95</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>102</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95 &lt; 102</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">102</span></span></span></span></span>，命中低水位</td>\n<td><strong>可见</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>101</td>\n<td>等于创建者</td>\n<td><strong>可见</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>102</td>\n<td>落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>102</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>105</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[102,105)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">102</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">105</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <code>102 ∈ m_ids</code></td>\n<td>不可见 → 回查 undo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>103</td>\n<td>落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>102</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>105</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[102,105)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">102</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">105</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 但 <code>103 ∉ m_ids</code>（已提交）</td>\n<td><strong>可见</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>106</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>106</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>105</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">106 \\ge 105</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">106</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">105</span></span></span></span></span>，超过高水位</td>\n<td>不可见 → 回查 undo</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;不可见&quot;不等于返回空：InnoDB 顺着回滚指针找到旧版本继续判定，直到遇到可见版本或链尾。官方明确 <code>DB_TRX_ID</code>（6 字节）&quot;indicates the transaction identifier for the last transaction that inserted or updated the row&quot;，<code>DB_ROLL_PTR</code>（7 字节）&quot;points to an undo log record written to the rollback segment&quot;（<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-multi-versioning.html\">InnoDB Multi-Versioning, MySQL 8.4</a>）。长事务拖慢读，正因版本链越长、回溯跳数越多，且这些 undo 一条都不能被 purge。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rc-与-rr-的-read-view-创建时机差异\">RC 与 RR 的 Read View 创建时机差异</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>REPEATABLE READ（默认）</strong>：&quot;all consistent reads within the same transaction read the snapshot established by the first such read in that transaction&quot;——<strong>一次创建，全程复用</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>READ COMMITTED</strong>：&quot;each consistent read within a transaction sets and reads its own fresh snapshot&quot;——<strong>每条语句各建一个</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比项</th>\n<th>REPEATABLE READ</th>\n<th>READ COMMITTED</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Read View 创建</td>\n<td>事务内第一次快照读</td>\n<td>每条快照读语句</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一事务两条 <code>SELECT</code></td>\n<td>结果一致（可重复读）</td>\n<td>可能不同（不可重复读）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快照寿命</td>\n<td>整个事务，到提交/回滚</td>\n<td>单条语句</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间隙锁</td>\n<td>范围查用 gap / next-key 锁</td>\n<td>仅外键与唯一键冲突检查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>想让快照提前到事务开头而非&quot;第一次读&quot;，用 <code>START TRANSACTION WITH CONSISTENT SNAPSHOT</code>；RR 下想拿更新快照必须先 <code>COMMIT</code> 再开新事务。两个例外：<strong>快照不约束写语句</strong>——&quot;applies to <code>SELECT</code> statements within a transaction, not necessarily to DML statements&quot;，RR 下一条 <code>UPDATE ... WHERE c2=&#39;abc&#39;</code> 仍可能改到别的事务刚提交的行；<code>INSERT ... SELECT</code> 的 SELECT 部分 &quot;acts like <code>READ COMMITTED</code>&quot;，退化成每条语句一个新快照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"当前读-锁语义-半一致性读与绕过快照的代价\">当前读：锁语义、半一致性读与绕过快照的代价</h2><p>当前读的定位是：<strong>当&quot;读到的值&quot;必须马上变成&quot;我能改且别人改不了的值&quot;时，快照读不够用</strong>。官方反例：先 <code>SELECT</code> 再写相关数据，普通 <code>SELECT</code> &quot;does not give enough protection. Other transactions can update or delete the same rows you just queried.&quot;</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>REPEATABLE READ</th>\n<th>READ COMMITTED</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>唯一索引 + 唯一条件</td>\n<td>只锁命中记录，不锁前面间隙</td>\n<td>同左</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围 / 非唯一条件</td>\n<td>用 gap / next-key 锁锁住扫描区间、挡插入</td>\n<td>只锁索引记录，允许相邻插入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不匹配的行</td>\n<td>保留锁（逐行 <code>retain x-lock</code>）</td>\n<td>评估完 <code>WHERE</code> 即释放（<code>unlock</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RC 少死锁靠<strong>半一致性读</strong>：&quot;InnoDB performs a &#39;semi-consistent&#39; read, returning the latest committed version to MySQL so that MySQL can determine whether the row matches the <code>WHERE</code> condition of the <code>UPDATE</code>&quot;，只有真正匹配的行才重新读并加锁（<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-transaction-isolation-levels.html\">InnoDB Transaction Isolation Levels, MySQL 8.4</a>）。同一个 <code>UPDATE t SET b=5 WHERE b=3</code>，RR 锁住扫过的全部 5 行，RC 只留住 2 行，代价是可能幻读。</p>\n<p><code>NOWAIT</code> &quot;never waits to acquire a row lock&quot;，锁被占直接报 <code>ERROR 3572 (HY000)</code>；<code>SKIP LOCKED</code> &quot;removing locked rows from the result set&quot;，但官方警告它返回 &quot;an inconsistent view of the data&quot;，&quot;not suitable for general transactional work&quot;。两者只作用于行级锁。队列消费偏爱 <code>SKIP LOCKED</code>，正因接受了不一致视图、换来无等待并发取件。官方还提醒 RR 事务别混用锁定与非锁定语句——前者看 Read View、后者看最新状态，这类事务&quot;typically should use <code>SERIALIZABLE</code>&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运维观察-history-list-purge-lag-与版本现状\">运维观察：history list、purge lag 与版本现状</h2><p>Read View 的运维后果集中一点：<strong>一个没关掉的 Read View 会让 undo 无法回收</strong>。<code>SHOW ENGINE INNODB STATUS</code> 的 <code>TRANSACTIONS</code> 段那行 <code>History list length</code> 就是它——反映多少 update undo 卡在 history list 上等 purge。最快的定位手段是查活跃事务时长：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT trx_id, trx_state,&#10;       TIMESTAMPDIFF(SECOND, trx_started, NOW()) AS age_s,&#10;       trx_isolation_level, trx_rows_modified&#10;FROM information_schema.INNODB_TRX&#10;ORDER BY trx_started;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trx_id, trx_state,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       TIMESTAMPDIFF(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SECOND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, trx_started, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_s,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       trx_isolation_level, trx_rows_modified</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> information_schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">INNODB_TRX</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trx_started;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>age_s</code> 异常大、隔离级别为 RR 且 <code>trx_rows_modified = 0</code> 的行，几乎就是&quot;只读长事务&quot;——<code>autocommit=0</code> 下忘了 <code>COMMIT</code>，或 <code>mysqldump --single-transaction</code> 在写入高峰运行。锁等待看 <code>performance_schema.data_locks</code> / <code>data_lock_waits</code>（8.0 起取代旧视图）。</p>\n<p>云上有一个具体差异：<strong>Aurora MySQL 的只读副本默认强制 <code>REPEATABLE READ</code>，并忽略 <code>SET TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL</code></strong>。若写密集 + 副本跑长查询导致 purge lag，可用会话级开关 <code>aurora_read_replica_read_committed</code>。但 AWS 明确说明副本上的 RC 比常规 MySQL RC 更弱——允许非重复读、幻读，甚至同一条查询里重复读到同一行；它能减轻 GC 开销，正因放弃了&quot;查询期间持有一致视图&quot;的保证。而 Aurora 主实例的 RC &quot;uses a strong consistency model similar to the REPEATABLE READ isolation level&quot;（<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/AuroraMySQL.Reference.IsolationLevels.html\">Aurora MySQL isolation levels</a>）。<strong>迁移到 RC 前要区分主实例 RC 还是副本 RC</strong>。</p>\n<p>版本层面，8.4 LTS 与 9.x innovation 均未改动 MVCC / Read View / 锁调度语义——<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/relnotes/mysql/9.0/en/news-9-0-0.html\">MySQL 9.0.0 Release Notes</a> 里相关条目只有 <code>sys.innodb_lock_waits</code> 视图性能改进这类外围变化。本文模型适用于 8.0 以来所有版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>普通 <code>SELECT</code> = <strong>快照读</strong>：不加锁，读 Read View 判定出的版本；撞上未提交事务不等待，而是回查 undo。</li>\n<li><code>FOR UPDATE</code> / <code>FOR SHARE</code> / <code>UPDATE</code> / <code>DELETE</code> = <strong>当前读</strong>：读最新已提交版本并加锁，锁在提交或回滚时统一释放。</li>\n<li>Read View = 低水位 <code>m_up_limit_id</code> + 高水位 <code>m_low_limit_id</code> + 有序活跃集合 <code>m_ids</code> + 创建者 <code>m_creator_trx_id</code> + purge 下界 <code>m_low_limit_no</code>。</li>\n<li>可见性判定就是一个谓词：低于低水位或等于自己可见；达到高水位不可见；夹在中间且不在 <code>m_ids</code> 里可见——判定用二分查找。</li>\n<li><strong>RC 与 RR 的唯一本质差异是 Read View 创建时机</strong>：RR 是&quot;第一次读建、全程复用&quot;，RC 是&quot;每读一次建一次&quot;。</li>\n<li>当前读里 RR 用 gap / next-key 锁挡插入并保留扫描过的行锁；RC 关间隙锁、只留匹配行锁，靠半一致性读降死锁，代价是可能幻读。</li>\n<li><code>NOWAIT</code> 锁被占立即报错；<code>SKIP LOCKED</code> 返回不一致视图，适合队列抢占而不适合通用事务。</li>\n<li>运维抓手是 <code>History list length</code> 与 <code>INNODB_TRX</code>：只读长事务会撑爆 undo、拉长版本链，是最高频的线上事故源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MVCC 与 Read View：快照读/当前读与 RC/RR 可见性差异","id":"mvcc-与-read-view-快照读-当前读与-rc-rr-可见性差异"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：快照读、当前读与 Read View 的三方关系","id":"核心概念-快照读-当前读与-read-view-的三方关系"},{"level":2,"text":"Read View 的内部结构：五个字段与可见性判定","id":"read-view-的内部结构-五个字段与可见性判定"},{"level":2,"text":"可见性判定推演：水位线与版本链回溯","id":"可见性判定推演-水位线与版本链回溯"},{"level":2,"text":"RC 与 RR 的 Read View 创建时机差异","id":"rc-与-rr-的-read-view-创建时机差异"},{"level":2,"text":"当前读：锁语义、半一致性读与绕过快照的代价","id":"当前读-锁语义-半一致性读与绕过快照的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"运维观察：history list、purge lag 与版本现状","id":"运维观察-history-list-purge-lag-与版本现状"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"崩溃恢复两阶段与双写缓冲：恢复失败排查与 force_recovery","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/mysql-innodb-storage-engine-mvcc-internals/redo-undo-wal-crash-recovery/crash-recovery-doublewrite-troubleshoot"},"next":{"title":"锁体系与死锁：记录/间隙/临键锁、意向锁与死锁日志分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/mysql-innodb-storage-engine-mvcc-internals/mvcc-lock-isolation-ops/lock-types-gap-next-key-deadlock"}}